  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b96x5i493e_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>无聊的按钮网站，每个月563K访问量，点击按钮，把你带到一个有趣的网站。 <a href=\"https://www.boredbutton.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.boredbutton.com/</a></div>\n<div>我们可以自己去提交网站，不过最好确保你的网站“有趣” <a href=\"https://www.boredbutton.com/add\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.boredbutton.com/add</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b96x5i493e_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b96x5i493e_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>在一些整理向的博文里，会介绍这个网站，所以各种外链加起来，这个站有1000个网站给他链接。 <a href=\"https://webflow.com/blog/useless-websites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://webflow.com/blog/useless-websites</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b96x5i493e_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
